        "height": "219",
        "name": "ROUNDED_RECTANGLE"
      },
      "text": "STAGE 4 — MEASURE, DOSE THE EXERCISE, RE-TEST\nEvery patient comes here from their exercise group. Everyone gets the same short core battery so results compare across patients and visits; the diagnosis adds one module; irritability (not the label) sets the starting dose; the STarT Back score sets HOW the programme is delivered."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "rWECNSFkKrOGuJkRPvsQdP:1:6799",
      "type": "shape-with-text",
      "attributes": {
        "id": "1:6799",
        "x": "820",
        "y": "489",
        "width": "560",
        "height": "197",
        "name": "ROUNDED_RECTANGLE"
      },
      "text": "LS4-1 · How irritable is the back?\nASK: “Tell me about your last bad flare. What sets the pain off, and how long does it take to settle?” Ask about the last 24 hours and about sleep too."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "rWECNSFkKrOGuJkRPvsQdP:1:7790",
      "type": "connector",
      "attributes": {
        "id": "1:7790",
        "x": "1100",
