      "text": "RE-CHECK BEFORE CONTINUING\nRe-run the Stage 1 safety screen; re-test directional preference (LT1); re-score STarT Back and yellow flags; physio video exam; doctor review if leg symptoms aren’t improving by 6–8 weeks."
